# Pull Before Commit

This repo may receive automated calendar updates on `main`.

Before committing or pushing, first check whether `origin/main` is ahead and pull the latest changes, preferably with rebase, to avoid conflicts.

Do not mix unrelated calendar updates into the user's commit unless explicitly requested.
